{"id":"658984","name":"酸梅鸭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658984/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭肉","amount":"600g"},{"name":"咸酸梅","amount":"3颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"2块"},{"name":"红葱头","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸭肉凉水入锅，放入姜片和料酒，焯水5分钟后捞出。","img":"images/658984/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"咸酸梅三粒，去掉核，把果肉压成泥，咸酸梅有点咸，后面制作食材时可以少放些盐。","img":"images/658984/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜片和葱头。","img":"images/658984/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧油，放入姜片和葱头炒香。","img":"images/658984/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入鸭肉翻炒。","img":"images/658984/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸭肉炒至干香，放入香叶、桂皮、八角。","img":"images/658984/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐、酱油、蚝油、老抽、料酒。","img":"images/658984/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入清水，没过鸭肉。","img":"images/658984/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入咸酸梅。","img":"images/658984/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入冰糖。","img":"images/658984/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火烧开后转中小火，焖半个小时。","img":"images/658984/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到，夹出大料，汤汁收至浓稠出锅。","img":"images/658984/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658984/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}